G.I18n.add({"Sp. Atk": "特攻", "Sp. Def": "特防", "Base stats · shared scale 0–255": "种族值 · 统一刻度 0–255", "Six-stat radar": "六维雷达图", "Radar de seis estadísticas": "六维雷达图", "Pokémon details show six stats in a radar with exact values and a shared scale.": "宝可梦详情改为六维雷达图，保留准确数值，并使用统一刻度。", "La ficha de cada Pokémon muestra sus seis estadísticas en un radar con valores exactos y una escala común.": "宝可梦详情改为六维雷达图，保留准确数值，并使用统一刻度。"},"zh-CN");

G.I18n.add({"Female sprite": "素材外观：雌性", "Brass sprite": "素材外观：头兵", "Roaming form": "徒步形态", "Temporary sprite": "素材外观：暂定版", "Low-Power Mode sprite": "素材外观：限制模式", "Nueve compañeros recuperados": "新增九位宝可梦伙伴", "Nine recovered partners": "新增九位宝可梦伙伴", "Nueve Pokémon con animaciones reales, repertorios propios, estadísticas y variantes de aspecto identificadas.": "新增九种具备真实战斗动画的宝可梦，配置独立技能池、六维数据，并明确标注素材外观。", "Nine Pokémon with real animations, curated move pools, base stats and clearly labeled sprite variants.": "新增九种具备真实战斗动画的宝可梦，配置独立技能池、六维数据，并明确标注素材外观。"},"zh-CN");

G.I18n.add({"Upgrade active": "已有主动升级", "Upgrade passive": "已有被动升级", "New active": "学习新主动", "New passive": "学习新被动", "Unavailable": "暂无可选", "No eligible choice": "暂无符合条件的选项", "Active moves are capped; evolution may require a passive.": "主动招式已满级；招式进化可能需要对应被动。", "Learn a passive first, or all learned passives are capped.": "尚未学习被动，或已有被动均已满级。", "Active slots are full, or no new attacks remain.": "主动栏位已满，或当前没有可学习的新主动。", "Passive slots are full, or no new passives remain.": "被动栏位已满，或当前没有可学习的新被动。", "Growth complete": "成长已完成", "Recovery": "补给恢复", "All growth is capped. Restore 45% max HP and continue.": "全部成长均已满级，恢复45%最大生命并继续。", "Vitality": "体能", "Max HP +20 per level; recover the added HP.": "每级增加20点最大生命，并恢复新增的生命。", "Reflexes": "反射神经", "Attack cooldown -8% per level.": "每级使攻击冷却倍率乘以0.92。", "Pickup Magnet": "经验磁铁", "Experience pickup radius +30% per level.": "每级使经验拾取半径乘以1.30。", "Fast Learning": "快速学习", "Experience gained +12% per level.": "每级使经验获取倍率乘以1.12。", "Swords Dance / Calm Mind": "剑舞／冥想", "Defensive passive": "防御类被动", "Aqua Ring / Ingrain": "水流环／扎根", "Confirm": "确认", "Back": "返回", "Reroll / Help": "重选／求助", "Danger mark": "危险标记", "Previous attack": "上一个主动", "Next attack": "下一个主动", "Pause": "暂停", "Activate special": "发动特殊机制", "Switch special": "切换特殊机制", "Up": "上", "Down": "下", "Left": "左", "Right": "右", "Detect controller": "检测手柄", "Export controller diagnostics": "导出手柄诊断", "Calibrate controller": "校准手柄", "Generic USB controls are enabled. Calibrate only if buttons or axes differ.": "已支持非标准USB手柄；按键或摇杆不对应时再校准。", "Move right": "校准向右移动", "Move down": "校准向下移动", "Cancel calibration": "取消校准", "Reset controller mapping": "重置当前手柄映射", "Controller input is disabled.": "手柄输入已关闭。", "Gamepad API is unavailable. Open the HTTPS game page in Chrome.": "当前页面没有手柄接口，请使用Chrome打开HTTPS游戏页面。", "The browser blocked controller access.": "浏览器阻止了当前页面读取手柄。", "No controller exposed by the browser. Tap this page, then press a controller button.": "浏览器尚未上报手柄。请先点击游戏页面，再按手柄按键。", "Standard controller detected.": "已检测到标准手柄。", "Unmapped USB controller detected; generic controls are enabled.": "已检测到非标准USB手柄，通用控制已启用。", "Buttons": "按键数", "Axes": "轴状态", "Pressed": "已按下", "Release controls, then move the stick right.": "先松开所有按键和摇杆，再把移动摇杆推向右侧。", "Release controls, then move the stick down.": "先松开所有按键和摇杆，再把移动摇杆推向下方。", "Release controls, then press the desired controller button.": "先松开所有按键，再按下希望绑定此功能的手柄按键。", "Controller mapping saved.": "手柄映射已保存。", "Connect a controller and enable controller input first.": "请先连接手柄并启用手柄输入。", "Calibration cancelled.": "已取消校准。", "Controller mapping reset.": "当前手柄映射已重置。", "Cuatro opciones y mandos USB": "四类升级与USB手柄", "Four reward lanes and USB controllers": "四类升级与USB手柄", "Las mejoras de partida se unifican como pasivas; cuatro categorías de cartas, evolución vinculada y detección/calibración de mandos USB sin mapa estándar.": "局内强化统一为被动招式，升级固定四类选项，进化条件同步调整；支持非标准USB手柄检测、校准和诊断。", "Run upgrades merge into passives; four reward categories, updated evolution requirements and detection/calibration for unmapped USB controllers.": "局内强化统一为被动招式，升级固定四类选项，进化条件同步调整；支持非标准USB手柄检测、校准和诊断。"},"zh-CN");

